    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 52,
        "text": "Hi, Tom. You look worried. What's the problem?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "252a087f717cdbe1f0884329fa794d641a184565b9d601ae1ea957995524e5ed",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 58,
        "sourceEnd": 168,
        "text": "It's the community garden. The water bill doubled this month. We need to decide how we should share the water.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "22dd3eec7a50d4ccb03145a756bdc3740f26a8debd05393edf177cc8d815a1e3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 175,
        "sourceEnd": 225,
        "text": "I see. Do you know why the bill increased so much?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "c8ce4e9d535002ab3fb6a80caade20b7ddbdae78ec7e6cdcc046183df2d1f99c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 231,
        "sourceEnd": 323,
        "text": "The hot weather, I think. Also, some people leave the tap running. I'm not sure who does it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "d135978b6d17d025fcd73ff61335f280b19c4364a7d96778f62b569df1ed9fec",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 330,
        "sourceEnd": 406,
        "text": "We could ask everyone to use less water. But what if the vegetables dry out?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "b6e054fa3e7b92912a744777e7059ab58dd3594d73163bf3f29c7d8e44a6ae03",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 412,
        "sourceEnd": 522,
        "text": "That's the trade-off. If we cut water by half, some plants may die. If we don't cut it, we can't pay the bill.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f704de1f6dd6ab5d9ce78b7fa4a1a16ec4cd6bbe6d066d34e2e310fcf1f29784",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 529,
        "sourceEnd": 580,
        "text": "Have you asked the other gardeners what they think?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5dbdcb743f5b07425a032129848759ae6289e6b94ac78f4aabfca5addaa66f29",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 586,
        "sourceEnd": 709,
        "text": "Yes, I spoke to three of them. They said they would accept a schedule. One person asked whether we could collect rainwater.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "41709853d3352d78b3830f8e11899fced687de4db325a46b062e149d12b01863",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 716,
        "sourceEnd": 774,
        "text": "That's a good idea. Do you know how much rain we get here?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5371140aca14a44edd9d834df6126ca3b0d58445f776b3bae37d9b1343fe12ae",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 780,
        "sourceEnd": 855,
        "text": "Not much in summer, but we can try. The problem is the cost of the barrels.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "af14c06a1345eb6dd97c38f7473cc4c150708ab5aea4afe1203ef4b9fd1d525e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 862,
        "sourceEnd": 926,
        "text": "Could we ask the city for help? I wonder if they have a program.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5c7f3bd0590f798b32a3c4133ed4f719c3586b8a31a9ecca626e6546e940e686",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 932,
        "sourceEnd": 1008,
        "text": "Maybe. But I don't know when they would reply. We need a decision this week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "1067ce02b010fd35f6a0db761ed03a1d8a23bb7163888b2139d04b0a1fbb6ed4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1015,
        "sourceEnd": 1048,
        "text": "Let's compare the options. Option",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "d50dae71580a20bb8918cf47e25e44f168d7276b3a173fb6076ace36298b1da3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 1052,
        "sourceEnd": 1103,
        "text": "everyone waters only on Monday and Thursday. Option",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "49d51d1d199ccd4f16160f7a21501cbb908c291f68d2af96acf62308b9ab01cf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 1107,
        "sourceEnd": 1148,
        "text": "each person gets a fixed amount per week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "cf85c7ce6c5ff9e14edf61e37ae8d38830a55186a76e9187af530f5a695c3be6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1154,
        "sourceEnd": 1254,
        "text": "Option B sounds fairer, but it's harder to check. Option A is simpler, but some people might forget.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "83ad075f1ad1e873a017cc1ce8853599679d6646cbb3775b8f541070895e590a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1261,
        "sourceEnd": 1329,
        "text": "What if we try Option A for one month and see if the bill goes down?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "625babee821f44ca7d436f94534df6d1c3cce0f126157f8be5ca97cbc0766e7f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1335,
        "sourceEnd": 1409,
        "text": "That's a good compromise. But we must explain clearly why we are doing it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "9951cb10db5921b46f683bd66606b4788972ba840959efadc69485aa1f45424a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1416,
        "sourceEnd": 1505,
        "text": "I can write a notice. I'll ask people to tell me if they have problems with the schedule.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "1eb13e7632bc72f429a413bb6036a140986d0cf292bba24773625d4b747e51f3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1511,
        "sourceEnd": 1577,
        "text": "Thanks, Maya. Could you also ask whether anyone has extra barrels?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "cb98f0a34c2d51619efd3488e3c3f9d89c89eb4453910ae66e347d8563b70cc9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1584,
        "sourceEnd": 1609,
        "text": "Sure. I'll do that today.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "430432fac38f3d55c2bc21f3837992a00821eacb45c84332775182d5fd1b5c46",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
